WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.309 --> 00:00:03.142
(audience cheers)

00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:07.485
- We've got some fans.

00:00:07.485 --> 00:00:08.318
- Just.

00:00:08.318 --> 00:00:09.151
- We've got,

00:00:09.151 --> 00:00:09.984
got a few fans.

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:11.161
- Thank you.

00:00:11.161 --> 00:00:13.680
(audience cheers)

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.820
- I mean, I swear to God,

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.140
I don't think like Harry Styles

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.370
gets that kind of entrance here.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.958
That was amazing.

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:21.508
- Harry Styles doesn't hang
out in the parking lot.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.970
- I love a good tailgate.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:24.960
So I'm there.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:25.793
Do you know Laura?

00:00:25.793 --> 00:00:26.626
Have y'all ever met before?

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:27.750
- No, I thought I thought it was so cool,

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.583
the fact that,

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:29.880
we both said it's, it's nice to meet like

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:30.713
like see her,

00:00:30.713 --> 00:00:31.583
like wow.
- Yeah.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:32.416
It was like, so cool.

00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:33.249
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:34.380
You're both very kind.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.213
- Thank you.

00:00:35.213 --> 00:00:36.046
- Yes.

00:00:36.046 --> 00:00:37.050
- So wait, this is huge.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.790
So you're the first
comedian to ever do standup

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:39.623
at Dodger Stadium.

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:40.650
First of all, I said to her
right before you came out,

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:41.520
I was like

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.570
doing Dodger Stad-

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:43.552
That's amazing.

00:00:43.552 --> 00:00:44.600
You know how many people fit in there?

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.433
(audience applauds)

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:47.089
That's incredible.

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:48.683
Like, is this just like,

00:00:48.683 --> 00:00:50.310
are you freaking out?

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:51.570
- It's, it's very surreal

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.940
because I've been to the
ballpark a million times.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:55.140
Been going there since I was a kid.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:55.973
And so the fact that

00:00:55.973 --> 00:00:57.180
this show's gonna happen

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:58.980
it's like the biggest
thing I've ever done,

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.526
and it's at home.
- [Laura] Isn't that amazing?

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.158
- I know, that's so cool.

00:01:02.158 --> 00:01:03.457
Do you get,

00:01:03.457 --> 00:01:05.310
do you get excited about home crowds

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:06.510
or do you get nervous?

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:08.400
- I used to get really
nervous about home shows

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.967
cause then you know,
you get the phone calls,

00:01:09.967 --> 00:01:11.250
"Hey man what's up?"

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.840
People I haven't heard from all year,

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.700
you know, necesito boletos.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.690
I'm like, great

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:17.220
I gotta hook up tickets.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:18.053
Right?

00:01:18.053 --> 00:01:18.886
And so, you know,

00:01:18.886 --> 00:01:19.834
and then just people coming out that

00:01:19.834 --> 00:01:22.000
I haven't seen in a long time.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.833
- [Gabriel] So it's a
little extra pressure.

00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:25.140
- Do you say ticketmaster.com?

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:25.973
- Nice.

00:01:25.973 --> 00:01:26.970
- [Kelly] Do you send them there?

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:27.840
- You can't,

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:28.673
Well, first of all,

00:01:28.673 --> 00:01:29.580
with Mexican families it's hard

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:30.960
because they guilt you.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:31.793
- Yeah.

00:01:31.793 --> 00:01:32.626
- It's something all the time, if I-

00:01:32.626 --> 00:01:34.590
- I think you don't have to be Mexican.

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:35.490
All families will,

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.645
there's a level of guilt happening.

00:01:36.645 --> 00:01:37.478
Yes.

00:01:37.478 --> 00:01:39.360
- But they bring in
religion and your childhood.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.980
- Ah, so do Southern Baptists.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:43.703
- [Gabriel] Oh, okay. (both laugh)

